SUBGRAPH: Transaction gas limit validation path. P2P received transactions go through EthTransactionValidator::validate_one_no_state, which checks gas_limit against MAX_TX_GAS_LIMIT_OSAKA (16777216). However, there is no explicit peer penalization/scoring mechanism visible in the reth codebase for peers that send over-cap transactions.

TEST_PROCEDURE: 1. Configure a test peer to repeatedly send transactions with gasLimit > 16777216. 2. Monitor peer score changes on the receiving node. 3. Verify the peer is eventually disconnected after threshold violations. 4. Test that legitimate peers are not penalized for occasional invalid transactions. 5. Review peer scoring configuration for appropriate thresholds.
